LASACT is an Approved Educational Provider (AEP) through ADRA.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
CONFERENCE (lasact.org/lasactconference)
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
Annual conference spanning 4 days, 30+ credit hours.
Topics include: breaking stigmas, current drug trends, addiction prevention, career opportunities.
Free conference registration included with membership.

